<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 14 0 R /Rect [ 56.696999 488.645968 538.617004 745.925967 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure1) /TU (Diagram illustrating a financial decision-making model with two main modules: "Intelligent Processing" and "Knowledge Supplementation." The process begins with difficulty classification of a question about investing $10,000. The Intelligent Processing Module includes "Financial Strategy Plan," "Modal Recognition," and "Domain Feature Engineering," focused on data analysis and handling. The Knowledge Supplementation Module involves "Indicator Trend Summary," "Complete COT," and "Executable Training Pipeline," emphasizing summary, consultation, and implementation. The narrative incorporates specific financial events and their implications. Both modules use robotic figures to symbolize automation and AI in processing tasks.) /Type /Annot >>
